WEBVTT

00:46:28.913 --> 00:46:31.288
or the time that they spent
it open their equity here.

00:46:32.038 --> 00:46:35.788
And then beyond that, all the value
flows back to the nonprofit

00:46:35.788 --> 00:46:39.746
and we figure out how to share it as
fairly as we can with the world.

00:46:40.121 --> 00:46:42.538
And I think that this structure

00:46:42.538 --> 00:46:45.038
and this nonprofit with this very
strong charter in place

00:46:45.038 --> 00:46:48.913
and everybody who joins signing up
for the mission come in first and

00:46:48.913 --> 00:46:51.829
the fact the world may get strange,
I think that.

00:46:53.788 --> 00:46:55.663
That was at least the best idea
we could come up with,

00:46:56.371 --> 00:47:01.038
and I think it feels so far like the
incentive system is working,